### Requests against the local CAP server: npm run watch (http://localhost:4004)
### Logins (mocked, package.json -> cds.requires.[test].auth):
###   Admin: meera.iyer@psa-demo.com / admin      User: rahul.sharma@psa-demo.com / user
### Active records of draft entities are addressed with IsActiveEntity=true

@server = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/psa
@admin = Basic meera.iyer@psa-demo.com:admin
@user = Basic rahul.sharma@psa-demo.com:user

### Metadata of the service
GET {{server}}/$metadata
Authorization: {{admin}}


### Who is logged in (roles, linked employee)
GET {{server}}/whoAmI()
Authorization: {{user}}


### $top, $skip, $count, $select, $filter, $expand

### Read all clients
GET {{server}}/ClientSrv
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Read the first 2 projects
GET {{server}}/ProjectSrv?$top=2
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Read projects 3 and later by skipping the first 2
GET {{server}}/ProjectSrv?$skip=2
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Number of employees
GET {{server}}/EmployeeSrv/$count
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Only some fields of the employees
GET {{server}}/EmployeeSrv?$select=fullName,jobTitle,email,isManager
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Only T&M projects (eq, ne, gt, ge, lt, le)
GET {{server}}/ProjectSrv?$filter=BILLING_TYPE eq 'T%26M'
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Tasks that used 80 % or more of their estimate
GET {{server}}/TaskSrv?$filter=BURN_PERCENT ge 80&$select=TASK_NAME,ESTIMATED_HOURS,ACTUAL_HOURS,BURN_PERCENT
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Project with budget, milestones and tasks
GET {{server}}/ProjectSrv(NODE_KEY=40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001,IsActiveEntity=true)?$expand=BUDGET,MILESTONES($expand=TASKS)
Authorization: {{admin}}


### ---------------- Functions ----------------

### Budget, hours, burn rate and projected completion of a project
GET {{server}}/getBurnSummary(projectID=40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Manager Home KPI: number of active projects ($apply = aggregation)
GET {{server}}/ProjectAnalytics?$apply=aggregate(ACTIVE_COUNT)
Authorization: {{admin}}


### ---------------- Timesheets (User) ----------------

### My timesheets (row-level restriction: only own)
GET {{server}}/TimesheetSrv?$filter=IsActiveEntity eq true
Authorization: {{user}}

### Import hours from a time tracker into the draft timesheet (date;task;hours;billable;notes)
POST {{server}}/TimesheetSrv(NODE_KEY=70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004,IsActiveEntity=true)/PSAService.importHours
Authorization: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rows": "2026-10-13;Data migration;4;yes;imported"
}

### Submit the timesheet for approval (instance-bound action)
POST {{server}}/TimesheetSrv(NODE_KEY=70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004,IsActiveEntity=true)/PSAService.submitTimesheet
Authorization: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### ---------------- Approvals (Admin) ----------------

### Timesheets waiting for approval
GET {{server}}/ApprovalSrv
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Approve a timesheet: hours roll up to task, milestone, project and budget
POST {{server}}/ApprovalSrv(70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)/PSAService.approveTimesheet
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Reject a timesheet (reason is mandatory)
POST {{server}}/ApprovalSrv(70000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003)/PSAService.rejectTimesheet
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Please split the hours by task"
}


### ---------------- Billing (Admin) ----------------

### Generate an invoice for a project and period (action bound to the invoice list)
POST {{server}}/InvoiceSrv/PSAService.generateInvoice
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectID": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "periodFrom": "2026-09-01",
  "periodTo": "2026-10-31"
}

### Draft invoices
GET {{server}}/InvoiceSrv?$filter=STATUS eq 'Draft'
Authorization: {{admin}}


### ---------------- Configuration and audit (Admin) ----------------

### Settings (thresholds, tax, payment terms)
GET {{server}}/SettingsSrv(ID=1,IsActiveEntity=true)
Authorization: {{admin}}

### Latest 10 audit log entries
GET {{server}}/AuditLogSrv?$orderby=TIMESTAMP desc&$top=10
Authorization: {{admin}}

### A User cannot read clients (403)
GET {{server}}/ClientSrv
Authorization: {{user}}
